  ('zcrm_1579374000064277164', 'Wendy Scipione', 'Active HS Member', 'zcrm_1579374000000088015', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Active Advisor', 'Raissa', 'Wilkes', 'zcrm_1579374000000157741', 'Wendy Scipione', 'raissa_wilkes@hotmail.com', NULL, '970-215-6757', NULL, '9702156757', '1986-09-30', 'zcrm_1579374000000157007', 'Patti Baron', 'zcrm_1579374000000086007', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2021-02-24 13:52:35', '2025-08-08 14:52:33', 'Raissa Wilkes', '2201 Crazy Horse Circle', 'Edwards', 'CO', '81632', FALSE, NULL, 'wohlg1md@hotmail.com', 'USD', 1.0, '2025-11-10 07:53:29', NULL, 'Matthew Wohlgemuth (removed eff 11/1/22)', '6/21/1982', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '521712718', 'We would like to find a plan to keep indefinitely. We are tired of switching plans every 6 months. Neither of us smoke or use any tobacco products I was recently diagnosed with hyperthyroid/Graves'' disease and have been having some issues with abnormal Pap smears. I also had a bout with kidney stones in March 2013, but haven''t had any episodes since then. I had ankle surgery in 2007. Matt has had some surgeries in the past: ankle, neck and shoulder in 2013 and knee in 2008 or so. 
It is tough to predict our income from May going forward. We are both working under our own LLC''s, so would you need our gross income or net income after expenses?  Just a rough initial guess, I doubt we will make over $75k combined this year, but it''s tough to know for sure. This is artery transitional time for me as I just left my job of the last 8.5 years and am going into a new career. 
I do have a few doctors I would like to keep. Dr. Cheryl Kohn at Colorado Mountain Medical and Dr. Rebecca Adochio at Vail Valley Medical Center.  We also use Vail Integrative Medical Group for Chiropractic, if that would be covered and Dr. Jonathan Haerter at Vail Dentistry if we can get dental coverage.
Our zip code is 81632 and full names and dobs are Raissa Marie Wohlgemuth 9/30/1986 and Matthew David Wohlgemuth 6/21/1982.', 'Zion Health', 'Wellfit Newsletter May-Sent

