  ('zcrm_1579374000064735014', 'Wendy Scipione', 'Enrolled - 2021', 'zcrm_1579374000000088015', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Non-Member Referral', 'Lily', 'Valentine', 'zcrm_1579374000000157741', 'Wendy Scipione', 'LilyValentine@me.com', NULL, '719-332-8408', NULL, NULL, '1997-11-18', 'zcrm_1579374000000088015', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'zcrm_1579374000000086007', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2021-03-08 11:56:15', '2025-08-08 14:52:33', 'Lily Valentine', NULL, NULL, 'CO', '80013', FALSE, NULL, NULL, 'USD', 1.0, '2025-08-08 14:52:33', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<b>8/3/2015 11:05 AM</b>: WS- Speaking with Dexter Brooks about paperwork showing proof of increased income.<hr /><b>7/27/2015 03:09 PM</b>: WS- Sharon and 2 kids on HES and busband William on CO Health Op plan bc of his health issues. Sharon is 5''6 and 215. Might need health coach.<hr /><b>7/9/2015 01:24 PM</b>: WS- Interested in HES mostly but curious about Anthem and CO Health Op also.<hr /> 
